    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac65106e63175.87295201\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">McDonald's Australia is offering World of Warcraft in-game rewards and game time through rewards points!<br><br>Three weeks ago, McDonald's Australia <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/mcdonalds-australia-offering-wow-forever-beta-access-with-reward-points-382912\" data-contiguous=\"true\">offered a WoW: Forever Beta key</a> using rewards points! Now, McDonald's Australia is offering more rewards for World of Warcraft.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"seo.png\" width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55613.png?maxWidth=400\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.7117437722419929\"></div><br><br>For 2,000 MyMacca's points, players can redeem:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=68385/lil-ragnaros\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Lil' Ragnaros\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_boss_ragnaros.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Lil' Ragnaros</span></a> - A pet worth $10 USD on <a href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-gb/product/world-of-warcraft-pet-lil-ragnaros\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Battle.net</a>.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q2 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=250293/red-hot-portable-bakery\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Red Hot Portable Bakery\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_special_food_d_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Red Hot Portable Bakery</span></a> - The previous <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/mcdonalds-red-hot-portable-bakery-transmog-now-available-in-ireland-and-the-uk-382619\" data-contiguous=\"true\">McDonald's reward.</a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">14 Days of Game Time</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div><br><br>It'll be interesting to see if McDonald's does more promotions with WoW and if these promotions will come to other countries.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>McDonald's Australia is offering World of Warcraft in-game rewards and game time through rewards points!<br /><br />Three weeks ago, McDonald's Australia <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/mcdonalds-australia-offering-wow-forever-beta-access-with-reward-points-382912\">offered a WoW: Forever Beta key</a> using rewards points! Now, McDonald's Australia is offering more rewards for World of Warcraft.<br /><br />For 2,000 MyMacca's points, players can redeem:<br /><ul><li><a href=\"/item=68385/lil-ragnaros\">Lil' Ragnaros</a> - A pet worth $10 USD on <a href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-gb/product/world-of-warcraft-pet-lil-ragnaros\" rel=\"nofollow\">Battle.net</a>.</li><li><a href=\"/item=250293/red-hot-portable-bakery\">Red Hot Portable Bakery</a> - The previous <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/mcdonalds-red-hot-portable-bakery-transmog-now-available-in-ireland-and-the-uk-382619\">McDonald's reward.</a></li><li>14 Days of Game Time</li></ul><br /><br /><a href=\"/npc=51600/lil-ragnaros\">Lil' Ragnaros</a><a href=\"/item=250293/red-hot-portable-bakery\">Red Hot Portable Bakery</a><br /><br />It'll be interesting to see if McDonald's does more promotions with WoW and if these promotions will come to other countries.</noscript>            \n        ",
