    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac6515682cc65.83233020\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Players on the Forever Beta were delighted this week to discover <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274748/booty-bay-bruisers-buckshot\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Booty Bay Bruiser's Buckshot\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_02.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Booty Bay Bruiser's Buckshot</span></a> available at Honored with the Booty Bay Faction.  This gun had a special on-use effect and knocked back the player (or NPC) that you shot with it.  <br><br>Naturally, chaos ensued, as can be seen in this video below from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Payowow\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Payo</a>.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><br><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9NFNXeR1kEk/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 640px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 56.25%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div><br></div><br><br>Unfortunately (or fortunately, depending on your stance on being catapulted to your doom), this item has now had a hotfix applied, and the knockback has been removed.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304954.png\" id=\"1304954\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304954.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Booty Bay Buckshot\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.99625 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a> <br></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Players on the Forever Beta were delighted this week to discover <a href=\"/forever/item=274748/booty-bay-bruisers-buckshot\">Booty Bay Bruiser's Buckshot</a> available at Honored with the Booty Bay Faction. This gun had a special on-use effect and knocked back the player (or NPC) that you shot with it. <br /><br />Naturally, chaos ensued, as can be seen in this video below from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Payowow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Payo</a>.<br /><br />Unfortunately (or fortunately, depending on your stance on being catapulted to your doom), this item has now had a hotfix applied, and the knockback has been removed.<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
